  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Instead of legs, you have a long, sinuous tail like that of a great serpent. If you are naga, this serpentine tail is a sign to all who know that you were never human.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Character level 1st only, Naga only or Shenxue with a snake-like aspect only.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The sinuous movement of your tail allows you to move quicker; your base movement speed is now 40 feet. Due to your more predatory appearance and more natural reptilian scent, animals are much more nervous around you. You receive a -4 penalty to Wild Empathy checks, Handle Animals, but gain a +4 bonus to Acrobatics, Climb, and Swim skill checks. You receive a -6 penalty to Ride skill checks. Due to the extraordinary length of your coiled tail you now gain a +1 to grapple checks and a -1 to your AC as though you were size Large; however, you do not gain any of the other benefits or penalties of being size Large. For all other purposes you are considered to be Medium size.</p>\n<p><strong>Improved:</strong> Unlike other talents, the character can purchase a general feat as if taking it a second time. The character gains the Constrict universal monster ability (based damage 1d6 medium).</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> The character can never take any feat that specifically involves a mount or the use of two legs.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/jade-feats#toc120\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
